# Without this, `COPY src/ src/` drags the host's bin/ and obj/ directories into the
# image and overwrites the restore output generated inside the container, which fails
# the publish with NETSDK1064 ("package was not found ... since NuGet restore").
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.vs/
**/.idea/

.git/
.github/
.vscode/

analytics/
docs/
deploy/terraform/
tests/

**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/.ipynb_checkpoints/

**/*.user
**/.env
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
